{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 7000}, "text": " Hi, just a quick follow-up video to this SMEG oven thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 7000, "to": 12000}, "text": " I think I might have, well, fixed it, in quote marks."}, {"offsets": {"from": 12000, "to": 16000}, "text": " You can see down there that I've disabled the arm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 16000, "to": 21000}, "text": " The arm that holds the, let me get this open,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 21000, "to": 24000}, "text": " that holds this interlink in place here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 24000, "to": 27000}, "text": " This is the lock. This is like, you know, the child lock"}, {"offsets": {"from": 27000, "to": 32000}, "text": " and also the safety lock when it's doing the high temperature cleaning mode and stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 32000, "to": 37000}, "text": " Anyway, I just switched it on and it's back operational."}, {"offsets": {"from": 37000, "to": 39000}, "text": " Um, like, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 39000, "to": 45000}, "text": " Okay, so it looks like there is like a gearbox problem in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 45000, "to": 47000}, "text": " What that is, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47000, "to": 51000}, "text": " But when you take off the load from it, which is that arm,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 51000, "to": 56000}, "text": " which is really like, you know, quite a decent load on the thing,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 56000, "to": 58000}, "text": " then it just powered up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 58000, "to": 63000}, "text": " Because it does, part of its power-on test is to actually test that that interlock works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 63000, "to": 67000}, "text": " So it goes open, close, and then it detects that the micro switches are, you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 67000, "to": 69000}, "text": " doing their thing and stuff like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 69000, "to": 72000}, "text": " And that's why I was getting that F03 error message."}, {"offsets": {"from": 72000, "to": 77000}, "text": " But simply disabling that, and we don't use that lock anyway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 81000}, "text": " So, yeah, simply disabling that, got it back."}, {"offsets": {"from": 81000, "to": 83000}, "text": " And I presume it's going to work because it's always worked."}, {"offsets": {"from": 83000, "to": 84000}, "text": " It's always heated up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 84000, "to": 86000}, "text": " It's just that interlock problem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 86000, "to": 90000}, "text": " So I'm going to call that winner, winner, chicken dinner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 90000, "to": 91000}, "text": " And it should never use that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 91000, "to": 92000}, "text": " It should never do that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 92000, "to": 94000}, "text": " Actually, let me try it now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 94000, "to": 96000}, "text": " If I do the lock thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 96000, "to": 97000}, "text": " Here we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 99000}, "text": " If I hold down both of these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 99000, "to": 100000}, "text": " Let's hang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 100000, "to": 104000}, "text": " Let's have a look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 104000, "to": 106000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 106000, "to": 108000}, "text": " No."}, {"offsets": {"from": 108000, "to": 110000}, "text": " Hang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 110000, "to": 113000}, "text": " It's not even doing the lock thing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 113000, "to": 114000}, "text": " Nope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 114000, "to": 115000}, "text": " Nope."}, {"offsets": {"from": 115000, "to": 117000}, "text": " Doesn't even want to do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 117000, "to": 118000}, "text": " Ah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 118000, "to": 119000}, "text": " Ah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 119000, "to": 120000}, "text": " Damn."}, {"offsets": {"from": 120000, "to": 121000}, "text": " All right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 121000, "to": 123000}, "text": " Well, I'm not sure, but."}, {"offsets": {"from": 123000, "to": 124000}, "text": " Oh, oh, no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 124000, "to": 125000}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 125000, "to": 126000}, "text": " Lock."}, {"offsets": {"from": 126000, "to": 128000}, "text": " Use the lock."}, {"offsets": {"from": 128000, "to": 130000}, "text": " I can hear it moving."}, {"offsets": {"from": 130000, "to": 132000}, "text": " Oh, I can physically see it going."}, {"offsets": {"from": 132000, "to": 133000}, "text": " Oh, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 133000, "to": 134000}, "text": " It's physically."}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 138000}, "text": " Yeah, look, it's, that armature's physically moving there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 140000}, "text": " And, oh, yeah, it stopped."}, {"offsets": {"from": 140000, "to": 143000}, "text": " You probably saw it when it got to that interlock position."}, {"offsets": {"from": 143000, "to": 144000}, "text": " There."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144000, "to": 148000}, "text": " So, yeah, and now I can unlock it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 148000, "to": 150000}, "text": " Hopefully."}, {"offsets": {"from": 150000, "to": 152000}, "text": " Yeah, and it's going to go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 152000, "to": 153000}, "text": " Oh, it goes in a circle."}, {"offsets": {"from": 153000, "to": 154000}, "text": " It doesn't go backwards."}, {"offsets": {"from": 154000, "to": 155000}, "text": " Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 156000}, "text": " Of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 156000, "to": 157000}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 157000, "to": 160000}, "text": " And you can see it'll stop."}, {"offsets": {"from": 160000, "to": 166000}, "text": " Hopefully when it gets to the next interlock position."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 167000}, "text": " Ah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 167000, "to": 169000}, "text": " Oh, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 169000, "to": 170000}, 